  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Swarm. The swarm can occupy another creature's space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny raven. The swarm can't regain Hit Points or gain Temporary Hit Points.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Animals",
        "section": "13.87",
        "heading": "Traits",
        "lineStart": 28867,
        "lineEnd": 28869
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Beaks. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage, or 2 (1d4) Piercing damage if the swarm is Bloodied.\n\nCacophony (Recharge 6). Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 10, one creature in the swarm's space. Failure: The target has the Deafened condition until the start of the swarm's next turn. While Deafened, the target also has Disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Animals",
        "section": "13.87",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 28871,
        "lineEnd": 28875
      }
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Medium Swarm of Tiny Beasts, Unaligned\n\nAC 12\nInitiative +2 (12)\nHP 11 (2d8 + 2)\nSpeed 10 ft., Fly 50 ft.\n\nSkills Perception +5\nResistances Bludgeoning, Piercing, Slashing\nImmunities Charmed, Frightened, Grappled, Paralyzed, Petrified, Prone, Restrained, Stunned\nSenses Passive Perception 15\nLanguages None\nCR 1/4 (XP 50; PB +2)\n\nTraits\n\nSwarm. The swarm can occupy another creature's space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny raven. The swarm can't regain Hit Points or gain Temporary Hit Points.\n\nActions\n\nBeaks. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage, or 2 (1d4) Piercing damage if the swarm is Bloodied.\n\nCacophony (Recharge 6). Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 10, one creature in the swarm's space. Failure: The target has the Deafened condition until the start of the swarm's next turn. While Deafened, the target also has Disadvantage on ability checks and attack rolls.",
